    "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:e2deb2a226a7aff0ad37c47dbce3c52e19b376a7d5dd96d625e192ba8cef6dab",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_00_5:1_5_001_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "楽しみだな、今日の仕事。\nファンを喜ばせてみせるぜ！",
        "text": "好期待啊，今天的工作。\n我一定会让粉丝们开心的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:dfa2189ce754a692e83d3693cad798c63fc2afa72b2720c1511badd3f2810b3e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_00_5:1_5_001_00_5:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:49c1bd9b6a4c243934bfa43952902cd797661bbf725ffb594fd8be6ef40b2519",
      "title": 181,
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日の収録、選手紹介がメインなんだよな。\nずっと楽しみにしてたんだ！",
        "text": "今天的录制主要是介绍选手对吧。\n我一直都很期待呢！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:27e6c6219bceb05599768a225278d1efbc7387cb130792a540b1d4a6af5d3ba3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_04:1_5_001_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_002sht_1_5_002_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:a3d9bcd6cf619a5ad7fabf6f42c6cf3d997520b9ea34f14d582a93e3ccbb8a94",
      "title": 184,
      "opening": {
        "source": "いよいよ本番か～。今まで取材してたみんなと\n一緒に踊れるなんて楽しみだなぁ～！",
        "text": "终于要正式开始了～。能和之前一直跟拍采访的\n大家一起跳舞，好期待呀～！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5fd3a7289e8a1cfad627bae1e09d4cb7265e6db42f1360a9940950cc8c5da9af",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_03:1_5_002_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_004ter_1_5_004_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:8cd3da04fea176ed27d9e96ea34e89b57a4c26b54dd057ce62d9d207dec03259",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_004ter_1_5_004_00_4:1_5_004_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "よーし、気合い入れていくぜ。\n●●●●プロデューサーも見ててくれよな！",
        "text": "好——，干劲十足地上吧。\n●●●●プロデューサー也要看着我哦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:f93ac6105cf7f6b32f960b6f40eeb5b7899215f84388f136c783c1872e0e94f4",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_004ter_1_5_004_00_4:1_5_004_00_4:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_005kao_1_5_005_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:8fd0220c110136c581d0cc8e5acb3f53d8abbdcc119ef8c296f585f56aeecd18",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_00_0:1_5_005_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "この本か？　今度の仕事に役立ちそうだと思ってな。\n読み応えがあってなかなか面白い。",
        "text": "这本书吗？我觉得会对下次的工作有帮助。\n很有读头，相当有趣。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ff15cae41da06963d853014ab5d12876179df5a46b0eb4cf6000a9ebbb5d8af7",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_00_0:1_5_005_00_0:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_005kao_1_5_005_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:9df6435dcbc554e8f84eb6bb0a587c41999bba03e54beec498b9f7b7fdca11b2",
      "title": 194,
      "opening": {
        "source": "薫さん、鉄道会社の旅行誘致のお仕事が\n決まりました！",
        "text": "薰先生，铁路公司旅游推广的工作\n定下来了！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5ffecf953522ad14979f3766d9d143ea1afc40cf9bd465225e7b539328a44aee",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_01:1_5_005_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_007kei_1_5_007_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:a9dec020b51290d5ea93f471085cb91bddd889c5cb2bef13278955611791807a",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_007kei_1_5_007_00_6:1_5_007_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "これから振り付けの確認なんだ。\n僕なりに頑張ってくるよ。",
        "text": "接下来要确认动作编排呢。\n我会按自己的步调努力的。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:f2fcd78a796115f39b89c51f5f879f24ee7596a880138c9df89964c595e1cd35",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_007kei_1_5_007_00_6:1_5_007_00_6:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:335d75bc89501b1ceee7faf906b7761232fc272a7e7eea9c0522701eeb5cbd5d",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_00_7:1_5_009_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "演技のレッスンで表情の作り方を褒められたんだ。\n次の仕事に生かしていけるようにする。",
        "text": "演技课上做表情的方法被夸奖了。\n争取能运用到下次的工作中去。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:979af2458ecca87aefcf75b5f105ce3d84f60962e2b312c39229e3de9ad59b4b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_00_7:1_5_009_00_7:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:0f689cd3a5ea7ab1dea0a21707904f017065d1cb8ca914030acbb0e4e8f4f048",
      "title": 211,
      "opening": {
        "source": "ここは……そうか、こっちのルートからじゃないと\n先に進めないのか。",
        "text": "这里是……原来如此，不从这条路线走的话\n就无法继续前进了啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:66fd8f4a5d164b4715a933ae22e9fb8580c97cda4c3f177405e663a386ca66e3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_02:1_5_009_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_010pie_1_5_010_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:efd12d02ba5d00d9358c12c184e038038b3cf01fdfe134547148099481ef5ea9",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_00_7:1_5_010_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "お疲れさま、でした！\nレッスン大変。でも、楽しい！",
        "text": "辛苦了！\n上课好累。但是，好开心！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b69811be0dc5c7618d515ac2b28883ea275a74d8b8410cd7be09f49e3f872b4e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_00_7:1_5_010_00_7:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_010pie_1_5_010_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:f2e47bd7b8e782a2653244777bcf38aa5ebc1b46b5a585c8db849b1b9de16ca3",
      "title": 215,
      "opening": {
        "source": "もう間もなく収録が始まります。\nピエールさん、準備はいいですか？",
        "text": "录音马上就要开始了。\n皮埃尔先生，准备好了吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:27618b94634a0d7068464c77274b0c932af31867f060f7a95cf14c925ba6c9d7",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_02:1_5_010_02:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_012yus_1_5_012_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:8a039083db7ad0aecc3757199a59b221d69a8c1df9ad96264efa79166769e852",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_00_2:1_5_012_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "そろそろリハーサルが始まる時間だよね。\nよーし、気合い入れて頑張るぞ！",
        "text": "差不多到彩排开始的时间了呢。\n好——，打起精神加油啦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ebc5537decdc0d0815e5ba6e9fa04d8baa97bc8aa3cca83915ff3981c9c07b7c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_00_2:1_5_012_00_2:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:d5c0e813a2f2f703ccf4f422da0782a0e0bcdf6653ba202e5965826487fb5da2",
      "title": 228,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「お、おい……その生命体がどういうものなのか\nわかってるのか！」",
        "text": "“喂、喂……你知道那个生命体到底是什么东西吗！”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:318a4d61403decb4d500827fe93b0403537dbc21d36f0343a2a91f6c044e1394",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_03:1_5_013_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:aea3234022421fd94f99c919b3244c749f73df6578a02ce1b9e2cc102f17c092",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_8:1_5_014_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "あんたの言う通り、パンケーキの生地にマヨネーズを\n混ぜたらすげぇ美味かった！　弟たちも喜んでたぜ！",
        "text": "照你说的，在松饼的面糊里加了蛋黄酱之后\n超级好吃的！弟弟们也吃得很开心哦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:45a3c7b7d9bedd55c0a5ff2a57e67b81ef6d42db9ab8eb3927f6bbabd934e229",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_8:1_5_014_00_8:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_016sei_1_5_016_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:6db2a64e5351308c5611a21e059821cf465343fb1de19a3153c9078a2a818d05",
      "title": 240,
      "opening": {
        "source": "次のシーン、誠司さんの長台詞ですね。",
        "text": "下一场戏，是诚司先生的大段长台词呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:dfe0e495be48b3f29eb10b137dd0f7604313ad1cffc0851b77232295087b274f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_03:1_5_016_03:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_019kur_1_5_019_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:52b52268912f3787273e8afb5c6f6f377364a65dbca05db07a7f3f3e4400b320",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_019kur_1_5_019_00_5:1_5_019_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "私は人としてもアイドルとしてもまだまだです。\n努力を怠ることなく、精進して参ります。",
        "text": "无论是作为一个人，还是作为一名偶像，我都还尚欠火候。\n我定当毫不懈怠，努力精进自身。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8b48244a23d9a3ef6e3b8c6f0903ecc960a34629d8f4f2a4e7c422993d0490d8",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_019kur_1_5_019_00_5:1_5_019_00_5:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_019kur_1_5_019_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:71e9bc65acc16fd6df7b4f642960787ed8340826dcc72cceb24ed89d7c23e9da",
      "title": 253,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「貴様、何を言っている！\n我は決して敵に屈したりしない！」",
        "text": "“休得胡言！\n吾绝不会向敌人屈服！”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:7dfdcc1ec42538dd29adb584fd4d5ebecdab9bc23f31325ad3cf58a13a8ca37c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_019kur_1_5_019_04:1_5_019_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_021jun_1_5_021_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:6555be8d8cba5447d933730a53ac838af5e55c1cefaea761b0b4e01f38f20cb1",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_00_0:1_5_021_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ファンのみなさんの期待に応えられるように、\n頑張りたいと思います。",
        "text": "为了回应粉丝们的期待，\n我希望能竭尽所能。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:dad912bf874df31b5dfb092fd1aa2ae64eea0b454388db8fe532f32564a6ad55",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_00_0:1_5_021_00_0:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_021jun_1_5_021_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:77d28f32e6f8dd4bf9ff7bc93d2830574d9618a5943fb3da3db9eaa49de09a53",
      "title": 258,
      "opening": {
        "source": "お疲れさまです。\nおや？　これは……カップスープですか？",
        "text": "辛苦了。\n哎呀？这是……杯汤吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:263d1911beff5253db5f37b4f6097596e88e9f4b9b0531af4f8317a3a4a3865e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_01:1_5_021_01:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:559803a601796e8a21bee1f67818db97ca58c21c35570d398a3bf1c7bece31da",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_8:1_5_022_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "はあ……はあ……もう、動けない……。\n少し、休ませて……。",
        "text": "哈啊……哈啊……已经，动不了了……\n让我，休息一下……",
        "source_hash": "sha256:16cf32cd9cb670e7d853e0bd0238b5423d72eecc3d67460c245c048e7904d8cf",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_8:1_5_022_00_8:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_023har_1_5_023_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:3fd57ec4e2568552da7d277aec4ed20462029698cf659ad45544a5f58d686b35",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_023har_1_5_023_00_2:1_5_023_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ああ、準備ならできてるぜ。\nそれじゃ、いっちょやりますか！",
        "text": "啊啊，准备已经妥当啦。\n那么，就大干一场吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9caa96fd9470f108083a7b80707e17313144a5bc51bf0c203e580f94fb9ab076",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_023har_1_5_023_00_2:1_5_023_00_2:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:66ac35f0b74cdc0d3803b0b58a6e946d0c236dca9d22d3c21558fd51ca381d63",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_00_7:1_5_025_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "くぅー！　次の仕事まで待ち切れねぇッ！\nじっとしてられねぇから、表走って発散してくるぜ！",
        "text": "呜——！等不及下一份工作了！\n根本坐不住，我去外面跑两圈发泄一下！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:6d5a506d838423e73219244c7a0e639daf39fe65800e5701fb153178dbd86899",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_00_7:1_5_025_00_7:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:f8f87c71313bfa0a68aff593aa3726a2020ad4dff2806f36ee289d90c6f6966e",
      "title": 275,
      "opening": {
        "source": "ラジオ収録お疲れさまでした。\nゲストでの出演でしたが、どうでしたか？",
        "text": "广播录制辛苦了。\n这次是客串出演，感觉怎么样？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:26c71645260be8dd63bbd234acdcf8b6ad3b516457943b958db71aaed7b01faf",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_02:1_5_025_02:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_026gen_1_5_026_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:fe09f60e69e41f3fff762332d16c3f31674826ad8d4ab600c42966e44cf4aff0",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_00_1:1_5_026_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "朱雀はどんなことでも全力でぶつかる熱い漢だ。\n俺も負けてられねぇぜ！",
        "text": "朱雀是不管遇到什么事都会全力以赴的热血汉子。\n我也不能认输啊！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d1f3aa1c52ebe28b605440e2801b6a0374d7a7b2fd3660672900fc9b7dc2edc6",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_00_1:1_5_026_00_1:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:c64bb5ffabd6c9cb4dd0438860ceb09cb58c94df321c642ee3b1d22cd7a44e4f",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_00_2:1_5_027_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "プロデューサーさん、いいところに。\n次の仕事の相談をさせてくれないかい？",
        "text": "制作人，来得正好。\n能和我商量一下下一份工作的事吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ccfa62f61ec988ea2dd3d48771c43d56a9f72e7e2340ab14d471d964ce095a40",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_00_2:1_5_027_00_2:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_028soi_1_5_028_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:f6d04a84b90683d05cc639e5813f7ce39a328744a8f9932a603c762eb5ff44bf",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_028soi_1_5_028_00_2:1_5_028_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "スタッフさんにカップケーキを差し入れしたら、\n喜んでいただけました。",
        "text": "给工作人员们送了纸杯蛋糕当慰问品，\n大家都很高兴。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:7c4de9f58ad91b418208da7db746adbd6f64c5193c0a1e625e3c1a14b182000c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_028soi_1_5_028_00_2:1_5_028_00_2:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_029ass_1_5_029_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:756e76259abe1f927db40bfe7be0c6a7228c6f57e22cff0c922c4fc25dfdd7c4",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_029ass_1_5_029_00_4:1_5_029_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "暗黒の集いが終焉せし時、\nソーイチローと共に闇の供物を精製せん！",
        "text": "当暗黑集会终焉之时，\n便与庄一郎一同精制暗之供品吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b5d4509876510c5dc3f7cabaf7f9ce50da12bcfc370eb7f562281f119592ab07",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_029ass_1_5_029_00_4:1_5_029_00_4:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_030mak_1_5_030_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:be513ecb292e330084299265c81fd3ce42a65615eda46baf4c5cd491fcdfe181",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_030mak_1_5_030_00_6:1_5_030_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "疲れた時こそ、ケーキです！\nケーキを食べれば、元気になれちゃうんですよ。",
        "text": "正是累的时候，才更需要蛋糕！\n只要吃了蛋糕，整个人都会变得精神百倍呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4f96403059b90fa54aba40614a83a1c367acaf37d8bed209060a822aa89585b9",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_030mak_1_5_030_00_6:1_5_030_00_6:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_031sak_1_5_031_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:ca07a200de3c7e4b99b9456bb805a3999dfd954f7e4513a0178df9d425554e3c",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_00_6:1_5_031_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサー、かみや見なかった？\n一緒にランニングしてたんだけど……あっ、いた！",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，看到神谷了吗？\n刚才还一起跑步来着……啊，在那儿！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:978ff8189a6a278a15bf615d06f629fd12931a35ebc7a05df65f74b079361c83",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_00_6:1_5_031_00_6:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:b9305a967ffaadc500a0ac05546373435abe466238bcdc4833843f124dcadf49",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_8:1_5_033_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "やっぱダンスって楽しいよな。\nもう一回！　……よっと！",
        "text": "跳舞果然还是超开心啊。\n再来一次！……嘿咻！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:aea7951861566a0aeaeeddba30852c839276556b416e6c947772b4cd3e46fa0e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_8:1_5_033_00_8:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_034kan_1_5_034_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:81b2ca0add1c6b9ba20618bf7b2788c32dc792f532bf972040fe24b1daf777ab",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_034kan_1_5_034_00_7:1_5_034_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "かのん、もう動けないー。\nねーねー、おやつタイムにしようよー。",
        "text": "花音已经动不了啦～。\n呐～呐～，休息吃点心吧～。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:1614cd903267afd9bddfeaf9652d2abe0880eebee0265f37d085dba095cff87f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_034kan_1_5_034_00_7:1_5_034_00_7:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_034kan_1_5_034_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:598242a4c41fd1853d295f5062690f13b55dc7b91168b1bde7642f27bc393ca9",
      "title": 311,
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日はシチューのCM撮影になります。\nテーマは『家族団らん』。",
        "text": "今天是炖菜的CM拍摄。\n主题是“阖家团圆”。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5e84cce77d7f3e87defb130ae77759b84797b7c76c8ce1ff1528446c6031cd35",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_034kan_1_5_034_02:1_5_034_02:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_035mco_1_5_035_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:2fc16888e25ab27cf20aff342ba4778a59ba9b307ff0fdf35746326c912009fd",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_00_2:1_5_035_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "演技レッスンの計画を立てたいのだが、\n君の意見を聞かせてもらえるだろうか？",
        "text": "我想制定一份演技课程计划，\n能听听你的意见吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4c59d0a474062c03a678e6c820fa511d4011d7452feb6834d72418f21f5f1b03",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_00_2:1_5_035_00_2:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_037jir_1_5_037_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:f4db9fe025b6b10d32d04bd5ba0a4afc9d70d732b6ec1f51b79f39054ef0caa1",
      "title": 324,
      "opening": {
        "source": "（今日は情報バラエティー番組の収録で、\n猫カフェに来たけれど……）",
        "text": "（今天为了录制资讯综艺节目\n来到了猫咪咖啡厅，不过……）",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2ffe647bbf592e7e2763b0b133f905817204335d98c2a637290d7cc26deba4d4",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_03:1_5_037_03:cmd-000012:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:5900f6d9245e16eccd925164a5c3a0dd2a3101db4777eaea35ff021d122448fe",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_00_5:1_5_042_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "F-LAGSをもっと知ってもらいたいからのぉ。\n今日もぶち気合いが入っとるんじゃ！",
        "text": "因为想让更多人知道F-LAGS嘛。\n今天也是干劲满满哦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d846f1f5be530d449ac4d65ca172cbaa35245cffc98b675cc34b9bd7cb908650",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_00_5:1_5_042_00_5:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:eb0b26a0474c5b10f08f33e13b84b460f4c0e6d821a2c5dce27854276a798499",
      "title": 345,
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日は冷凍で人気の中華料理のCM撮影じゃな！\nよう見とるけぇ、親しみがあるのぉー。",
        "text": "今天是拍人气冷冻中华料理的广告呢！\n平时经常见，感觉很有亲切感啊～",
        "source_hash": "sha256:79b8002912a01c2e30796c11caeac08ddfb3d70f56662d49148354f38bd127df",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_04:1_5_042_04:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_044ame_1_5_044_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:f8bab7ac07d076e0c4dbd32528b5fd16a988a7c6c28121eaeedeec4795f5fab2",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_00_2:1_5_044_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "さて、無事に仕事が終わったわけだが、\nお前さんの感想を聞かせてもらえるかい？",
        "text": "好了，工作总算平安结束了，\n能让我听听你的感想吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:a0023a76f0061ff97c417bdf0663a668c14b27450352f1d24d49e4b019c17c4f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_00_2:1_5_044_00_2:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_045sor_1_5_045_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:eddab592af7da535c212a5825eeb497131d913266297e38d196e05e12d894855",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_045sor_1_5_045_00_1:1_5_045_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ああ、これ？　旅行雑誌だよー。\n休日に、旅に行く先見つけよう、ってねー。",
        "text": "啊，这个？是旅游杂志哦～\n难得放假，找找去哪里旅行，这样子～",
        "source_hash": "sha256:e5e176ef4868bdc5969fbee6fed6d8bc897e7a6c0625e47528ac1f85221efe36",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_045sor_1_5_045_00_1:1_5_045_00_1:cmd-000020:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:144b7369040d7bccf41b258162897e93ce4334c493fdca76a4c789e60ad6158d",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_8:1_5_046_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "レッスンの前に、軽くランニングをしておきますね。\nでは行ってきます。",
        "text": "上课前，我先稍微去跑跑步。\n那我先去了。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9707bbfd9cd3f540fd29c4a6775fc591a5307452ada92bee4606049255c7561d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_8:1_5_046_00_8:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:95bef3c9962278f6e4f62b2cd0e7fd5883b00c209e25c19e028c6a4a13617a3b",
      "title": 372,
      "opening": {
        "source": "おはようございます。\nええ、今日はテレビ番組の収録でして。",
        "text": "早上好。\n是的，今天是要录制电视节目。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d77cb024404855ab57a502795bfe75aaa0fcc4f39ffacc45b60c01f9c39cc0f3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "5_01_006_22_b": {
      "revision": "sha256:ff4118635aa1d4c5f3dbd1ab593521539774ec24f839f719f31b061cf8b908ee",
      "record": {
        "source": "あなたのおかげ",
        "text": "多亏了你",
        "source_hash": "sha256:0eee6d4cd77122a06842e68c762a9657e43b07233d1e73846d9b0ccf64b45923",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:0eee6d4cd77122a06842e68c762a9657e43b07233d1e73846d9b0ccf64b45923"
      }
    },
